= Majid Tavakoli

Majid Tavakoli is a student leader at Amir Kabir University in Tehran, and an eager speaker against Ahmadinejad's conservative government.

- @student_rally
- @student_strength
- @neighbourhood_youth
- @root: Return to main

@student_rally
title: Rally Students 
subtitle: Hold an event for Tehran students promoting reform.
choose-if: advisor_action_timer <= 0
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] months before next advisor action. ?] 
on-arrival: advisor_action_timer = 6; new_middle_spd += 6*(1-dissent);

We have increased our organizing among white-collar workers.

@student_strength
title: Union-party coordination
subtitle: Reduce dissent among the unions.
choose-if: advisor_action_timer <= 0
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] months before next advisor action. ?]
on-arrival: advisor_action_timer = 6; labor_dissent -= 10;

We have reduced tensions with the Labor faction.

